WEBVTT

00:00:00.169 --> 00:00:03.722
<v><b>Jemma:</b></v> …We don’t kiss goodbye, but when I’m waiting for my train,

00:00:03.778 --> 00:00:07.767
he runs up and gives me a cake from the restaurant to eat on the train!

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:11.735
Perhaps we can meet again and continue our conversation.

00:00:12.721 --> 00:00:14.978
I give the date eight out of ten.

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:18.472
<v><b>Pietro:</b></v> …It’s an unforgettable evening.

00:00:18.814 --> 00:00:25.049
In fact, truly unforgettable, because during the dinner her shirt catches fire!

00:00:26.341 --> 00:00:28.186
I’d really like to meet again.

00:00:28.809 --> 00:00:31.812
I give the date nine out of ten.